{"item_id": "6aee09889bb3", "section": "What's new in Django 4.2 / Minor features / django.contrib.gis", "text": "The GeoIP2 class now supports .mmdb files downloaded from DB-IP."}
{"item_id": "0b39c2b85aa2", "section": "What's new in Django 4.2 / Minor features / django.contrib.gis", "text": "The OpenLayers template widget no longer includes inline CSS (which also removes the former map_css block) to better comply with a strict Content Security Policy."}
{"item_id": "920728eda979", "section": "What's new in Django 4.2 / Minor features / django.contrib.gis", "text": "OpenLayersWidget is now based on OpenLayers 7.2.2 (previously 4.6.5)."}
{"item_id": "98d69ee45f54", "section": "What's new in Django 4.2 / Minor features / django.contrib.gis", "text": "The new isempty lookup and IsEmpty() expression allow filtering empty geometries on PostGIS."}
{"item_id": "fd4c081b396e", "section": "What's new in Django 4.2 / Minor features / django.contrib.gis", "text": "The new FromWKB() and FromWKT() functions allow creating geometries from Well-known binary (WKB) and Well-known text (WKT) representations."}
{"item_id": "6711379f2817", "section": "What's new in Django 4.2 / Minor features / django.contrib.postgres", "text": "The new trigram_strict_word_similar lookup, and the TrigramStrictWordSimilarity() and TrigramStrictWordDistance() expressions allow using trigram strict word similarity."}
{"item_id": "207215457e7f", "section": "What's new in Django 4.2 / Minor features / django.contrib.postgres", "text": "The arrayfield.overlap lookup now supports QuerySet.values() and values_list() as a right-hand side."}
{"item_id": "5e9e90597547", "section": "What's new in Django 4.2 / Minor features / django.contrib.sitemaps", "text": "The new Sitemap.get_languages_for_item method allows customizing the list of languages for which the item is displayed."}
{"item_id": "4af961482975", "section": "What's new in Django 4.2 / Minor features / django.contrib.staticfiles", "text": "ManifestStaticFilesStorage now has experimental support for replacing paths to JavaScript modules in import and export statements with their hashed counterparts. If you want to try it, subclass ManifestStaticFilesStorage and set the support_js_module_import_aggregation attribute to True."}
{"item_id": "1ea3d002d0fe", "section": "What's new in Django 4.2 / Minor features / django.contrib.staticfiles", "text": "The new ManifestStaticFilesStorage.manifest_hash attribute provides a hash over all files in the manifest and changes whenever one of the files changes."}
{"item_id": "2dc75fae1632", "section": "What's new in Django 4.2 / Minor features / Database backends", "text": "The new \"assume_role\" option is now supported in OPTIONS on PostgreSQL to allow specifying the session role."}
{"item_id": "5ad7bf2db53d", "section": "What's new in Django 4.2 / Minor features / Database backends", "text": "The new \"server_side_binding\" option is now supported in OPTIONS on PostgreSQL with psycopg 3.1.8+ to allow using server-side binding cursors."}
{"item_id": "08fc5b888e48", "section": "What's new in Django 4.2 / Minor features / Error Reporting", "text": "The debug page now shows exception notes and fine-grained error locations on Python 3.11+."}
{"item_id": "4de2ba0c777a", "section": "What's new in Django 4.2 / Minor features / Error Reporting", "text": "Session cookies are now treated as credentials and therefore hidden and replaced with stars () in error reports."}
{"item_id": "955132e077e5", "section": "What's new in Django 4.2 / Minor features / Forms", "text": "ModelForm now accepts the new Meta option formfield_callback to customize form fields."}
{"item_id": "d2add36ec520", "section": "What's new in Django 4.2 / Minor features / Forms", "text": "modelform_factory now respects the formfield_callback attribute of the form's Meta."}
{"item_id": "90bf20360deb", "section": "What's new in Django 4.2 / Minor features / Internationalization", "text": "Added support and translations for the Central Kurdish (Sorani) language."}
{"item_id": "3c7b64e438ca", "section": "What's new in Django 4.2 / Minor features / Logging", "text": "The django-db-logger logger now logs transaction management queries (BEGIN, COMMIT, and ROLLBACK) at the DEBUG level."}
{"item_id": "07482177cb5b", "section": "What's new in Django 4.2 / Minor features / Management Commands", "text": "makemessages command now supports locales with private sub-tags such as nl_NL-x-informal."}
{"item_id": "795fa8c2e6c0", "section": "What's new in Django 4.2 / Minor features / Management Commands", "text": "The new makemigrations --update option merges model changes into the latest migration and optimizes the resulting operations."}
